# Fixture files are byte-exact decoder inputs and reference pixel dumps. Several of them contain no NUL byte
# in their first 8 KB, so git's heuristics would otherwise treat them as text and rewrite 0x0A/0x0D bytes on
# checkout with core.autocrlf. Force binary handling for everything except the human-readable files.
* binary
*.py text
*.json text
*.md text
.gitattributes text
